00:17:37.655 --> 00:17:42.461 align:start size:94% position:6%
<i> French gold expert
 Thomas Faucher and
 archaeologist John Ward are</i>

00:17:42.494 --> 00:17:46.331 align:start size:94% position:6%
<i> on the hunt for the origins
 of Tutankhamun's gold.</i>

00:17:46.764 --> 00:17:47.799
THOMAS: So, I'm going to...

00:17:47.832 --> 00:17:49.868 align:start size:97% position:3%
