 a box covered in acid-free
 paper inside the coffin to</i>

00:21:03.628 --> 00:21:07.098 align:start size:94% position:6%
<i> stop it from collapsing
 while they examine the tomb.</i>

00:21:07.131 --> 00:21:09.401 line:0%
(sighs).

00:21:09.434 --> 00:21:12.604 line:0%
ALEJANDRO: There, we
have been very lucky.

00:21:12.637 --> 00:21:15.073
It's impossible to explain
the feelings that I'm having.

00:21:15.106 --> 00:21:21.613 align:start size:94% position:6%
The burial consisted in two
coffins, the outer coffin
and the inner coffin.

00:21:23.081 --> 00:21:25.450 align:start size:94% position:6%
<i> NARRATOR: Among the
 debris of the outer coffin,</i>

00:21:25.483 --> 00:21:28.987 align:start size:88% position:13%
<i> Alejandro spots
 something extraordinary.</i>

00:21:32.657 --> 00:21:35.727 align:start size:88% position:13%
ALEJANDRO: It is full
of wooden models, but
unfortunately, the outer

00:21:35.760 --> 00:21:38.496
coffin fall over them.

00:21:38.529 --> 00:21:40.865
<i> NARRATOR: The chamber
 is full of model boats,</i>

00:21:40.898 --> 00:21:44.035 align:start size:84% position:16%
<i> similar to the one
 in Tutankhamun's tomb.</i>

00:21:44.068 --> 00:21:48.006
ALEJANDRO: To find
this funerary boat in
a tomb is rare today.

00:21:49.841 --> 00:21:53.845 align:start size:91% position:9%
<i> NARRATOR: But there's
 not just one, there are
 four, complete with crew.</i>

00:21:55.680 --> 00:21:59.918 align:start size:88% position:13%
ALEJANDRO: You want
to laugh, you want to
shout, you want to cry.

00:21:59.951 --> 00:22:04.589 align:start size:94% position:6%
<i> NARRATOR: This is the
 first time in seventy-years
 a set of boats like</i>

00:22:04.622 --> 00:22:06.925
<i> this has been found.</i>

00:22:08.092 --> 00:22:12.931 align:start size:91% position:9%
<i> This discovery gives
 Alejandro an extremely
 rare opportunity to study</i>

00:22:12.964 --> 00:22:16.601
<i> such important burial goods.</i>

00:22:19.470 --> 00:22:22.874
<i> But first he has to extract
 them from the tomb safely.</i>

00:22:23.875 --> 00:22:27.011
<i> Alejandro calls in his team
 of conservation specialists,</i>

00:22:27.044 --> 00:22:29.147
<i> Sara and Theresa.</i>

00:22:44.429 --> 00:22:47.632
<i> NARRATOR: Termites have
